{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026XKUzSLfjP11793445307.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>萬聖節前夕，全港多區都有活動，旺角有商場舉辦街頭派對。</p><p></p><p>這個叉燒包，加入這顆草莓作餡，是更加好味，還是好驚？這天可盡情釋放自己的想像力。沒有太醜樣，只有更抽象。一見發財，甚至被外星人綁架。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.MK 1830..jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026E8rg0IA1El1793445750.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>Matt稱：「萬聖節、否則怎會這麼多人？有些恐怖有些開心。」</p><p></p><p>旺角砵蘭街有商場聯同40多個租戶，封閉一段行車路，舉辦街頭派對。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.MK 1830._001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026T78c79YvAw1793445661.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>有免費人面彩繪、攤位遊戲，玩到累還有免費鬼怪「紅VAN」，載你去佐敦白加士街。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.MK 1830._004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261GDv46b3c61793445679.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.MK 1830._005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BPAQZDAATV1793445724.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>東莞遊客陳先生說：「很有氛圍，這裡人真的超多，不回去了，直接玩通宵。」</p><p></p><p>廣州遊客袁小姐表示：「待會還會去蘭桂坊的行程，後面若當天能回的話，就回到深圳那邊，從龍崗那邊，若不回的話就在這邊住宿。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.MK 1830._003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026AK502RaXs31793445702.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場還有免費的服飾體驗區，大家可選擇自己喜歡的「搞鬼」造型，立即套上就可以打卡。若果肚餓，現場還有多個攤位，售賣特色小食。</p><p></p><p>小食店東主林先生指出：「可能香港、內地的人，也想感受一下萬聖節，人流也不錯的，比想像中好，(生意)比上兩星期多約百分之20。」</p><p></p><p>活動舉辦一天，晚上十時結束。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:37.198239+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":436,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.795525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:26.795525+00:00","content_hash":"0b0aea645f865add5b22e7ff352ff87ff29f3564e564604130a6403340c97758","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}